95 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (No. Paid Pregnancy Leave is available only to employees who are disabled due to pregnancy, childbirth, miscarriage, termination of pregnancy, or related medical conditions. It does not provide leave for baby bonding. Non-birthing parents may still be eligible for other leave entitlements, such as CFRA or FMLA leave for baby bonding, or parental leave under the Education Code or CBA, if they meet the applicable eligibility requirements)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
