/K [7]
>>
endobj
156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (Because PPL is provided with full pay, employees should continue to earn full CalSTRS service credit while on leave. In addition, because PPL may not be deducted from an employee's accrued sick leave, employees may preserve more unused sick leave. Under existing CalSTRS rules, eligible unused sick leave may be converted to additional service credit at retirement. This will help address the long-standing inequity where women make an average of $100,000 less in retirement, due in part to reduced sick leave banks as a result of childbirth)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
