177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (Disability benefits are based on the date of disability. Under the terms of the CTA-endorsed Voluntary Disability plan, for most pregnancy-related disability claims you may be eligible for benefits starting 4 weeks prior to delivery and continuing for 6 or 8 weeks after delivery, depending on your specific situation. PPL is considered Deductible Income and would reduce any Disability Benefits you receive or are eligible to receive from The Standard. The minimum benefit you would receive on an approved claim is $30 per Regular Day of Required Attendance, plus any other additional benefits to which you are entitled)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
